1
00:00:00,280 --> 00:00:01,800
Você já teve coragem

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:03,350
de encarar o espelho

3
00:00:03,350 --> 00:00:04,250
da escola vazia

4
00:00:04,250 --> 00:00:05,050
no recreio?

5
00:00:05,780 --> 00:00:07,320
Nos anos noventa,

6
00:00:07,460 --> 00:00:08,850
em quase todo colégio

7
00:00:08,850 --> 00:00:09,650
do Brasil,

8
00:00:09,650 --> 00:00:10,450
bastava sussurrar

9
00:00:10,450 --> 00:00:10,950
um nome

10
00:00:10,950 --> 00:00:11,400
para esvaziar

11
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:11,800
o corredor:

12
00:00:12,360 --> 00:00:14,160
A Loira do Banheiro!

13
00:00:14,820 --> 00:00:16,350
Diziam que o ritual

14
00:00:16,350 --> 00:00:17,150
tinha regras

15
00:00:17,150 --> 00:00:17,980
muito exatas:

16
00:00:18,540 --> 00:00:19,250
chutar a porta

17
00:00:19,250 --> 00:00:19,850
da cabine

18
00:00:19,850 --> 00:00:20,780
três vezes,

19
00:00:21,150 --> 00:00:22,150
puxar a descarga

20
00:00:22,150 --> 00:00:23,040
três vezes,

21
00:00:23,490 --> 00:00:24,420
abrir a torneira

22
00:00:24,690 --> 00:00:26,250
e falar três palavrões

23
00:00:26,250 --> 00:00:27,000
olhando fixo

24
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:27,810
para o espelho.

25
00:00:28,490 --> 00:00:30,050
Mas de onde surgiu

26
00:00:30,050 --> 00:00:31,540
essa história absurda?

27
00:00:32,120 --> 00:00:33,400
Muita gente jura

28
00:00:33,400 --> 00:00:34,800
que ela nasceu

29
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:36,160
em Guaratinguetá,

30
00:00:36,410 --> 00:00:36,850
no interior

31
00:00:36,850 --> 00:00:37,250
de São Paulo,

32
00:00:37,250 --> 00:00:37,650
no fim do século

33
00:00:37,650 --> 00:00:38,050
dezenove!

34
00:00:38,680 --> 00:00:39,850
Lá viveu Maria Augusta

35
00:00:39,850 --> 00:00:40,960
de Oliveira,

36
00:00:41,420 --> 00:00:42,100
uma jovem rica

37
00:00:42,100 --> 00:00:42,650
que fugiu

38
00:00:42,650 --> 00:00:43,350
de um casamento

39
00:00:43,350 --> 00:00:43,950
forçado

40
00:00:43,950 --> 00:00:44,990
para Paris.

41
00:00:45,760 --> 00:00:46,500
Quando morreu

42
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:47,350
misteriosamente

43
00:00:47,350 --> 00:00:48,360
no navio de volta,

44
00:00:48,750 --> 00:00:50,150
seu corpo ficou exposto

45
00:00:50,150 --> 00:00:51,350
numa redoma de vidro

46
00:00:51,350 --> 00:00:52,510
no casarão da família.

47
00:00:53,120 --> 00:00:54,020
Anos depois,

48
00:00:54,310 --> 00:00:55,650
aquele mesmo casarão

49
00:00:55,650 --> 00:00:56,450
virou uma escola

50
00:00:56,450 --> 00:00:57,330
pública!

51
00:00:57,910 --> 00:00:58,750
E quando um incêndio

52
00:00:58,750 --> 00:00:59,550
misterioso

53
00:00:59,550 --> 00:01:00,850
atingiu o prédio

54
00:01:00,850 --> 00:01:01,750
em mil novecentos

55
00:01:01,750 --> 00:01:02,650
e dezesseis,

56
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:03,900
os alunos

57
00:01:03,900 --> 00:01:04,600
começaram a jurar

58
00:01:04,600 --> 00:01:05,850
que ela pedia água

59
00:01:05,850 --> 00:01:07,020
nos banheiros,

60
00:01:07,440 --> 00:01:08,700
com algodão no nariz

61
00:01:08,700 --> 00:01:09,970
para conter o formol!

62
00:01:10,720 --> 00:01:11,870
No fim das contas,

63
00:01:12,120 --> 00:01:13,650
ninguém nunca provou

64
00:01:13,650 --> 00:01:15,550
se o fantasma apareceu

65
00:01:15,550 --> 00:01:16,500
de verdade...

66
00:01:16,670 --> 00:01:17,650
mas até hoje,

67
00:01:17,650 --> 00:01:19,000
na hora de lavar o rosto

68
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:20,220
sozinho na escola,

69
00:01:20,730 --> 00:01:21,950
todo mundo dá

70
00:01:21,950 --> 00:01:22,650
aquela olhadinha

71
00:01:22,650 --> 00:01:23,250
desconfiada

72
00:01:23,250 --> 00:01:24,350
pro espelho!
